<title>HONG KONG: HK land auction-North Point site goes to Sino Land.</title>
<headline>HK land auction-North Point site goes to Sino Land.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sino Land group was the buyer of the Causeway Bay Police Station site in North Point that sold for HK$760 million at the Hong Kong government land auction on Wednesday, the auctioneer said.</p>
<p>Chief estate officer Paul Tam said an unlisted company was the buyer of the San Po Kong site in Kowloon sold for HK$61 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
